<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>small talk</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">phendste</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">under the rug</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">4PgzKYw2oFCQS4VPTMMAYx</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.900" end="00:03.210">We're just havin' fun</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:03.210" end="00:05.520">I'm not a good messenger</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:05.520" end="00:07.020">Hope you know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:06.630" end="00:09.990">'Cause I think about all the stupid things</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.990" end="00:11.490">That you don't</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.880" end="00:13.470">Should I talk about my messy hair?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.470" end="00:14.970">Or tell a joke?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.750" end="00:17.510">I don't know which one you care for</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.510" end="00:20.040">Or if you're already bored</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.040" end="00:23.640">Small talk is stupid but it's all needed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.640" end="00:27.760">If we talk about nothing than we'll talk about our feelings</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.760" end="00:31.490">And who wants to talk about that?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.490" end="00:36.530">It'll mess up all the fun that we have</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.530" end="00:44.530" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.780" end="00:53.300">It feels like I'm talking to a brick wall</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.300" end="00:54.800">Monotone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.290" end="00:56.360">All the messages we send</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.360" end="00:58.340">Are starting to slow</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.340" end="01:00.490">In some roundabout way</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.490" end="01:02.490">I'm a liar to your face</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.490" end="01:04.530">But I'll just keep going</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.530" end="01:07.200">'Cause I don't wanna fall from grace</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.200" end="01:11.270">Small talk is stupid but it's all needed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.270" end="01:15.390">If we talk about nothing than we'll talk about our feelings</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.390" end="01:19.070">And who wants to talk about that?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.070" end="01:21.710">It'll mess up the fun that we have</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.710" end="01:25.710" /></div></body></tt>